			"height": 340,
			"text": "## home-background\nimage\nstatus: done\nmodel: z-image\nsize: 1280x720\nseed: 21\nprompt: \"a small rented cottage bedroom at night in Vermont, a single lamp, a sensible quilt, red maple leaves pressed against the dark window, seen straight on from a security camera\"\n",
