			"id": "krea-prop-green",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## krea-prop-green\nstyle\n# Krea 2 props to cut out: a filmed 1990s look, flat on, on pure green.\ntemplate: \"A prop for a 1995 CD-ROM full-motion-video game, photographed straight on in a flat front view for chroma-key compositing: {prompt}. Isolated on a solid flat pure green #00FF00 background, evenly lit, no shadow on the background, no ground, no people, no text\"\n",
			"x": 0,
